WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:17,950
My coffee is that one thing I look forward to in the AM and allows me to handle a little bit of fasting. How much is too much?

00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:26,950
Well, if you don't have those defects on the coffee genes, I mean, technically you can drink three or four cups of coffee a day.

00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:33,950
Now, if you want to be really pure with intermittent fasting, you can drink coffee.

00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:49,950
And it's still be considered, it's still be considered a fast as long as you don't put anything in it. So if it's black coffee, technically, even the purists with intermittent fasting, that's still approved.

00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:56,950
So, I think you would have several cups of coffee a day and I think that's a problem.

